# Ruta 19 (Route 19: the sea south of Ciudad Ambar, C7, contract 53), 26 x 34. column = i, row = j. Ambar's sea (`mar_ambar`, its far wall is open now) arrives at the NORTH edge (spawn `north`); the open SEA
# (foam, 2 frames) is crossed on the Hidrodeslizador. Two walls of sea rocks (rows 9 and 19) cross it; their gaps (10,9) / (18,19) are watched by two SWIMMERS on sandbars (11,9) / (19,19), who look along the wall: a rider
# passing the free cell is next to them (sea tiles are solid for the sight rule, so a swimmer only sees at distance 1); two more swimmers on islets off the road (talk to them). Kelp beds (the water table rolls under them),
# buoys and lone rocks. At the SOUTH end the ice ISLAND of the Islas Escarcha: big pale ice slabs, snow drifts and ice pillars, a sign and the cave MOUTH (12,27) -> Islas Escarcha floor 1 (east side). Wild water table + the three rods.
@map ruta_19
@size 26 34
@interior no
@area ruta_19
@bg 0
@nofollow yes                   # contract 69: the follower stays out of the ferry and the sea
@surf yes
@fill sea_o
@encounters water rate=15
  urchip 36 38 5
  urchlord 36 40 45
  gleamlet 36 39 20
  clubrimp 36 40 15
  lazatee 38 40 10
  skipgoby 36 39 5
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  glidefin 20 24 40
  inkit 20 24 40
  flopfin 15 15 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  inkit 28 34 30
  glidefin 28 34 30
  barnacub 30 34 20
  urchip 30 34 20
@end
@spawn north 12 1 S
@spawn island 12 28 S
